<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Mission</title>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🛰️ Mission Orion</h1>
    <p>Exploring the possibilities beyond Earth.</p>
</header>

<hr>

<main>

<section>

    <h2>🌌 Mission Overview</h2>

    <p>
        Mission Orion is a fictional space exploration
        project created as an HTML learning project.
    </p>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🚀 Mission Timeline</h2>

    <ol>

        <li>
            <strong>Launch</strong>
            <p>Rocket launches from Earth.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Orbit</strong>
            <p>The spacecraft enters its planned orbit.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Research</strong>
            <p>Scientific instruments begin collecting data.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Return</strong>
            <p>The spacecraft begins its journey home.</p>
        </li>

    </ol>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>📊 Mission Status</h2>

    <p>Preparation</p>
    <progress value="100" max="100"></progress>

    <p>Launch Preparation</p>
    <progress value="80" max="100"></progress>

    <p>Research</p>
    <progress value="45" max="100"></progress>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🧑‍🚀 Crew</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Mission Commander</li>
        <li>Flight Engineer</li>
        <li>Science Specialist</li>
        <li>Communication Officer</li>
    </ul>

</section>

</main>

<footer>
    <hr>
    <p>Mission Orion — Educational HTML Project</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
